  "content": {
    "title": "Is Costco open on Easter Sunday? See retailer's Arizona hours",
    "text": "April 5, 2026, 5:02 a.m. MTCostco went viral for Easter this year because of a 10-pound, semi-solid chocolate bunny.Pete the Bunny, as the packaging names him, \"is 10 pounds of smooth, rich chocolate-turned-centerpiece basket, showstopper and egg-stagram sensation.\" Outside of huge chocolate bunnies, Costco also offers a wide variety of Easter specials, like chocolate eggs, carrot cake, lamb racks and a ham dinner meal kit.Unfortunately, fans of the Easter deals at Costco will have to stock up early because the warehouse is closed on Easter, which falls on April 5 this year.Costco closes its warehouses for seven holidays, including Easter. Here's the rest.Costco holiday hoursCostco is closed on these seven holidays:New Year’s DayEaster SundayMemorial DayIndependence DayLabor DayThanksgiving DayChristmas DayCostco Easter hoursCostco warehouses will be closed on Easter.Get the latest grocery news with Attention Shoppers, our weekly newsletter. Costco in ArizonaThere are 20 Costco locations in Arizona:Avondale: 10000 W. McDowell RoadBuckeye: 1111 N. Verrado WayChandler: 595 S. Galleria WayGilbert: 1415 N. Arizona Ave.Gilbert: 2887 S. Market St.Glendale: 17550 N. 79th Ave.Mesa: 1444 S. Sossaman RoadParadise Valley: 4570 E. Cactus RoadPhoenix: 19001 N. 27th Ave.Phoenix: 4502 E. Oak St.Phoenix: 3801 N. 33rd Ave.Phoenix: 2450 E. Beardsley RoadPrescott: 3911 E. State Route 69Queen Creek: 20260 S. Ellsworth RoadScottsdale: 15255 N. Hayden RoadSurprise: 16385 W. Waddell RoadTempe: 1445 W. Elliot RoadTucson: 1650 E. Tucson Marketplace Blvd.Tucson: 6255 E. Grant RoadTucson: 3901 W. Costco DriveReach the reporter at reia.li@gannett.com. Follow @reia_reports on Instagram.",
